    "text": "constantly illuminating our experience. And our subjective experience may not suggest that. We say to ourselves, okay, well, maybe now I'm aware. Yes, I hear you and I'm noticing awareness. I'm connected to my immediate felt experience right now. But for the last while, for the last 10 minutes, I wasn't. I was gone. I was lost in thought, distracted. So even though our experience of awareness seems to come and go, most fundamentally, and we'll explore this and really taste it and start to live in it during the program, awareness itself doesn't come and go.",
